Z||000014||fiero56||12-15-2000||11:56 PM||||If I'm reading your post right(it's late and I'm tired), I am considering it.<BR>Paint my SE black with silver ground effects. Then run the red pinstripe, fender badges, decklid sticer, and door decals, but white decals on black paint rather than other way around. Keep the tech wheels siver, and have a different "Indy". I think it would be pretty cool looking, definitely something I have never seen before.||||reg||1
